        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 1969, Elite Collection Charlotte Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 1969 Elite Collection Charlotte Cabinet Handle shows off the elegance and sophistication of the modern kitchen. Its strong lines are made bolder by the popular finish choices in which this cabinet door pull is available. The Charlotte Cabinet Pull is easy  to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 1969 pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/charlotte-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-1969p\"><b>Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>1969-102:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1969-153:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1969-203:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1969-254:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1969-305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1969-457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
